    ],
    "text": "NATIONAL ENVIRONMENTAL ACT NO. 47 OF 1980",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      430.69,
      537.89,
      465.76
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the President under Section 32 of the National Environmental Act, No. 47 of 1980, read withSections 23G of that Act and Section 51 of the Nineteenth Amendment to the Constitution of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      481.81,
      522.79,
      530.56
    ],
    "text": "MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA,President.Colombo,04th November, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      265.89,
      543.49,
      319.89,
      554.56
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      567.49,
      538.0,
      590.56
    ],
    "text": "1. These Regulations may be cited as the National Environmental (Ambient Water Quality) Regulations, No. 01of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      603.49,
      537.99,
      638.56
    ],
    "text": "2. No person shall discharge, deposit or emit any pollutant into the inland surface waters to exceed the AmbientWater Quality Standards (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cStandards\u201d) in relation to the categories specified in the Schedulehereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      651.49,
      537.88,
      674.56
    ],
    "text": "3. The Authority shall be responsible for the maintenance of the quality of inland surface waters in order toensure compliance with the Standards specified in the Schedule hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      687.49,
      537.91,
      710.56
    ],
    "text": "4. The Authority shall issue directives to any local authority to take appropriate measures to comply with theStandards specified in the Schedule hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      721.79,
      295.43,
      740.13
    ],
    "text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4738\u2014 2017 (11/2019)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      72.37,
      546.23,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'05PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 05.11.20192A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
