  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.15,
      100.93,
      188.36,
      112.0
    ],
    "text": "5. In these regulations -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      124.93,
      547.25,
      148.0
    ],
    "text": "\u201cAuthority\u201d means the Central Environmental Authority established under the National EnvironmentalAct, No. 47 of 1980 ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      160.93,
      547.23,
      184.0
    ],
    "text": "\u201cgeneral treatment\u201d means treatment of water using coagulation, flocculation, clarification and filtrationfollowed by disinfection ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      196.93,
      547.16,
      220.0
    ],
    "text": "\u201cInland surface water\u201d means any standing or flowing water on the surface of the land extending up to theboundary of the coastal water ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      232.93,
      451.76,
      244.0
    ],
    "text": "\u201cperson\u201d includes a body of persons whether incorporated or unincorporated ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      256.93,
      376.75,
      268.0
    ],
    "text": "\u201csimple treatment\u201d means simple filtration and boiled at 1000 C",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.800000190734863,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      275.11,
      292.93,
      327.31,
      304.0
    ],
    "text": "SCHEDULE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      193.75,
      316.93,
      408.56,
      328.0
    ],
    "text": "AMBIENT WATER QUALITY STANDARDS",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      340.93,
      198.56,
      352.0
    ],
    "text": "The Categories referred to below -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      79.15,
      364.93,
      480.73,
      436.0
    ],
    "text": "Category A shall be water that requires simple treatment, for drinking ;Category B shall be bathing and contact recreational water ;Category C shall be water sutiable for aquatic life ;Category D shall be water source that require to undergo general treatment process, for drinking ;Category E shall be water suitable for irrigation and agricultural activities ;Category F shall be water with minimum quality but does not fall into categories A to E.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
